---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Become a guard: MostWanted" description="Guards on MostWanted are picked by application. What guards do, what we look for, and how to apply.">
  <article class="page wrap">
    <h1>Become a guard</h1>
    <p class="lead">Everyone starts as an inmate. Guards are players we trust to keep the prison running, so they're picked by application.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What guards do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Patrol the prison and stop escapes before they happen.</li>
        <li>Answer robbery alarms in town and bring criminals in.</li>
        <li>Collect the bounty on every criminal they arrest.</li>
        <li>Hold the line when the inmates riot.</li>
        <li>Go off duty whenever they like and play as anyone else.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we look for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You've played on MostWanted and know how escapes, robberies and arrests work.</li>
        <li>A clean record: no recent bans or serious warnings.</li>
        <li>You play fair when you're winning and when you're losing.</li>
        <li>You'll use guard powers on the people breaking the rules of the game, not on your rivals.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The guard code</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Never help criminals: no letting friends go, no tip-offs, no passing gear.</li>
        <li>Only arrest or taser players who are escaping, rioting or wanted.</li>
        <li>No camping safe zones or spawns.</li>
        <li>Staff review guard reports. Breaking the code costs you the rank.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to apply</h2>
      <p>Applications open in the MostWanted Discord when the server launches. Link your Minecraft account there, fill in the application, and staff will get back to you.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
